 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Come on, find spot under an open window. Wasp nest something big going up high they can't reach. Then eat before you go out, or stay inside on days it looks like they'll be out. Wasp spray can drive them away from a doorknob. It gives the wasps a choice you'd avoid moving into their nest, and they leave alone. Try to push it off with a windowill or your umbrella if you' covered. If it attacks, follow the three L's, look, listen, leave.",
